{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Start an order"},"description":"Start an order JENNi will deliver, without leaving the chat. Give the exact product_id, the delivery address and the shopper's contact details. Returns the delivery options and the order total. Nothing is charged until complete_checkout. Delivered by JENNi.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"buyer":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"email":{"maxLength":254,"type":"string"},"first_name":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"last_name":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"phone_number":{"maxLength":32,"type":"string"}},"required":["email","phone_number","first_name","last_name"],"type":"object"},"delivery_address":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"city":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"country":{"enum":["US"],"type":"string"},"extended_address":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"first_name":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"last_name":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"postal_code":{"pattern":"^[0-9]{5}(-[0-9]{4})?$","type":"string"},"state":{"description":"2-letter US state.","maxLength":2,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"street_address":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"required":["street_address","city","state","postal_code"],"type":"object"},"idempotency_key":{"description":"Optional. Reuse the same value to retry safely; the retry returns the first result instead of acting twice.","maxLength":80,"minLength":8,"type":"string"},"product_id":{"maxLength":128,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,128}$","type":"string"},"quantity":{"description":"How many (default 1).","maximum":10000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["product_id","delivery_address","buyer"],"type":"object"},"name":"create_checkout","outputSchema":{"properties":{"checkout_id":{"type":["string","null"]},"continue_url":{"description":"Present when the shopper should finish on JENNi instead.","type":"string"},"curr